{"seq":1,"slug":"credit-tier-threshold","title":"信用等级与阈值","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-tier-badge/credit-tier-threshold","wordCount":2022,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"信用等级与阈值\">信用等级与阈值</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连续分数不适合直接对外沟通。商家看不懂「我的分从 742 掉到 718 意味着什么」，但看得懂「我从银牌掉到铜牌」。等级的作用是把连续分数<strong>离散化成语义档位</strong>，让权益规则、商家心智、内部治理三件事共用一套语言。</p>\n<p>离散化的第一步是划刀口。刀口不能等距——等距会让中段挤满商家、两端空旷，等级丧失区分度。消费信用领域的分档给出了可参照的形状：FICO 把 300–850 切成 exceptional / very good / good / fair / poor 五档，其中绝大多数人群集中在中段（见 <a href=\"https://www.myfico.com/credit-education/whats-in-your-credit-score\">myFICO: What&#39;s in your credit score</a>）。平台信用分同理，等级边界应当落在<strong>分布的高密度区域之外</strong>，让每一档都有稳定的成员基数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始信用分] --&gt; B{分位校准}&#10;  B --&gt; C[确定初始刀口&lt;br/&gt;按目标人数占比]&#10;  C --&gt; D[业务校准&lt;br/&gt;对齐权益成本]&#10;  D --&gt; E{是否稳定?}&#10;  E --&gt;|否| F[调整刀口&lt;br/&gt;或调整分数分布]&#10;  E --&gt;|是| G[发布等级映射表]&#10;  G --&gt; H[等级变更事件]&#10;  H --&gt; I[权益联动&lt;br/&gt;见权益章节]&#10;  H --&gt; J[等级变更通知]\">graph TD\n  A[原始信用分] --&gt; B{分位校准}\n  B --&gt; C[确定初始刀口&lt;br/&gt;按目标人数占比]\n  C --&gt; D[业务校准&lt;br/&gt;对齐权益成本]\n  D --&gt; E{是否稳定?}\n  E --&gt;|否| F[调整刀口&lt;br/&gt;或调整分数分布]\n  E --&gt;|是| G[发布等级映射表]\n  G --&gt; H[等级变更事件]\n  H --&gt; I[权益联动&lt;br/&gt;见权益章节]\n  H --&gt; J[等级变更通知]</pre><p>等级一旦与权益绑定，它就同时是<strong>承诺</strong>：升档意味着平台给出更多资源，降档意味着撤回。因此刀口调整必须走版本化流程，不能悄悄改。权益如何按档位差异化的细节见 <a href=\"../credit-benefit-link/traffic-payout-term-benefit\">流量/账期/保证金/活动权益</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>目标人数占比</th>\n<th>分数区间（示意）</th>\n<th>权益含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钻石</td>\n<td>3%–5%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>880</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[880, 1000]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">880</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最高流量权重、最短账期、零/低保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金牌</td>\n<td>15%–20%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>800</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>880</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[800, 880)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">880</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高流量权重、标准账期、低保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银牌</td>\n<td>35%–40%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>700</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>800</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[700, 800)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">700</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>基准流量、标准账期、标准保证金</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铜牌</td>\n<td>25%–30%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>600</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>700</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[600, 700)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">700</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>流量降权、保证金上浮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察</td>\n<td>5%–8%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>600</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0, 600)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>限制新客获取、缩短账期、提高保证金</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"阈值确定方法\">阈值确定方法</h2><h3 id=\"从目标占比反推-而不是从分数反推\">从目标占比反推，而不是从分数反推</h3><p>最稳的阈值确定顺序是「先定每档应有的人数占比 → 再看当前分数分布落在哪个分位 → 取该分位对应的分数作为刀口」。反过来做（先拍一个 800 分作为金牌线，再看有多少人够）会导致某些档位人数畸多或畸少，且每次分布漂移都要手动救火。</p>\n<p>实现上，取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个目标分位，刀口即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k = F^{-1}(q_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是当前全平台分数分布函数。这把「阈值设计」变成了「分位设计」，好处是阈值会随分布自动平移，永远保持各档占比稳定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分布漂移与阈值漂移的取舍\">分布漂移与阈值漂移的取舍</h3><p>自动平移有个副作用：<strong>当全平台整体变好时，阈值会上涨</strong>，商家的绝对分提高了但等级没变。这既公平（相对竞争）又不公平（努力没有回报）。取舍方式是按业务意图选择：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>绝对阈值</strong>：分数达标即升档。商家努力必有回报，但平台可能在某天发现 80% 的商家都是金牌，权益预算失控。</li>\n<li><strong>相对阈值（分位）</strong>：等级永远保持占比稳定。预算可控，但商家会觉得「我明明进步了却降档」。</li>\n<li><strong>混合</strong>：绝对下限 + 相对上限。例如「金牌需分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>780</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 780</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">780</span></span></span></span></span>，且不超过前 20% 的商家」。这是最常用的折中。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阈值类型</th>\n<th>权益预算可控性</th>\n<th>商家激励</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绝对阈值</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>强</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>权益成本低、以激励为主</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对阈值</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>弱（零和感）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>流量位、活动名额等稀缺资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合（下限+上限）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>账期、保证金等成本敏感权益</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"阈值数量与马丁格尔效应\">阈值数量与马丁格尔效应</h3><p>等级不宜过多。五档是常见上限，六档以上商家难以记住，内部沟通成本陡增。更隐蔽的问题是<strong>边界抖动</strong>：分数在刀口附近波动的商家会频繁升降档，每次升降都触发权益变更与通知，既是运营噪声也是不公平感来源。解决方案是给每档加<strong>滞回区</strong>——升档线高于降档线，形成一段缓冲。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>升档：</mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>降档：</mtext><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{升档：} s \\geq T_k + \\delta, \\qquad \\text{降档：} s &lt; T_k - \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">升档：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">降档：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 取该档分宽度的 2%–5% 时，抖动基本消除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级映射的工程实现\">等级映射的工程实现</h2><h3 id=\"映射表要可版本化-可回溯\">映射表要可版本化、可回溯</h3><p>等级不是分数的纯函数——它依赖当前生效的阈值版本。因此必须把「分数 → 等级」的映射及其版本独立存储，并在每次等级变更时记录当时使用的版本。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE credit_tier_scheme (&#10;  scheme_version TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  tier_code      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  min_score      NUMERIC(6,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  max_score      NUMERIC(6,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  hysteresis     NUMERIC(6,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  effective_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (scheme_version, tier_code)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE merchant_tier_state (&#10;  entity_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  tier_code      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  scheme_version TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  changed_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  prev_tier_code TEXT,&#10;  score_at_change NUMERIC(6,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  change_reason  TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (entity_id, changed_at)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> credit_tier_scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scheme_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  min_score      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  max_score      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hysteresis     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (scheme_version, tier_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merchant_tier_state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scheme_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  changed_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  prev_tier_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score_at_change </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  change_reason  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entity_id, changed_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>merchant_tier_state</code> 存的是<strong>变更事件</strong>而非当前状态，当前等级可由最新一条事件取得。这样做的好处是等级历史天然可回溯——当商家申诉「我上个月为什么被降档」时，可以直接读出 <code>score_at_change</code> 与 <code>scheme_version</code>，复现判定过程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"滞回在存储层怎么落\">滞回在存储层怎么落</h3><p>滞回意味着「当前等级」是判定的输入。因此等级计算函数必须接收 <code>prev_tier_code</code>，而不能只吃分数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def resolve_tier(score, scheme, prev_tier):&#10;    ordered = sorted(scheme, key=lambda t: -t[&quot;min_score&quot;])&#10;    for tier in ordered:&#10;        lower = tier[&quot;min_score&quot;]&#10;        buffer = tier[&quot;hysteresis&quot;]&#10;        if prev_tier == tier[&quot;tier_code&quot;]:&#10;            if score &gt;= lower - buffer:&#10;                return tier[&quot;tier_code&quot;]&#10;        elif score &gt;= lower + buffer:&#10;            return tier[&quot;tier_code&quot;]&#10;    return ordered[-1][&quot;tier_code&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> resolve_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(score, scheme, prev_tier):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ordered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sorted</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scheme, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=lambda</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">t[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ordered:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"min_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        buffer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hysteresis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        elif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> score </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lower </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> buffer:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ordered[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段逻辑的有状态性有一个直接后果：<strong>等级不能离线并行重算</strong>，必须按时间序重放。批量重算时必须从第一个事件开始逐个应用，不能对每条记录独立调用 <code>resolve_tier</code>，否则滞回会失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"等级变更的传播与通知\">等级变更的传播与通知</h2><h3 id=\"等级是事件源-不是查询结果\">等级是事件源，不是查询结果</h3><p>等级变更会触发权益调整（流量权重、账期、保证金），因此它应当被建模为<strong>领域事件</strong>向外发布，而不是让下游定期轮询 <code>merchant_tier_state</code>。事件驱动的好处是权益调整的延迟可控，且每次调整都有明确的触发因果可追溯。</p>\n<h3 id=\"升档与降档的传播策略不同\">升档与降档的传播策略不同</h3><p>升档可以立即传播，降档则需要<strong>延迟生效 + 提前通知</strong>。原因是降档会收回商家已有资源：账期从 15 天缩到 7 天可能让商家的现金流计划失效，保证金上浮需要时间筹钱。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更方向</th>\n<th>生效延迟</th>\n<th>通知提前量</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>升档</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>立即</td>\n<td>正向激励，越即时越好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降档（银→铜）</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n<td>给商家缓冲与申诉窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降档（铜→观察）</td>\n<td>14 天</td>\n<td>7 天</td>\n<td>涉及流量与账期双收缩，需充分告知</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个「提前通知 + 缓冲期」的做法与消费者信用领域的<strong>不利行动通知</strong>制度同源：当基于消费者报告作出不利决定时，使用者必须告知对方该决定、所依据的机构，以及其提出异议的权利（见 <a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/1681m\">15 U.S.C. § 1681m</a>）。平台对商家的降档通知在结构上可以直接沿用这套「说明依据 + 告知申诉路径」的形式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"通知内容必须包含可操作信息\">通知内容必须包含可操作信息</h3><p>「您已降级」是无效通知。有效通知要给出：触发的具体维度、该维度的当前值与门槛、恢复到上一档所需的条件与预计时间。这直接决定了商家下一步做什么，也是 <a href=\"../credit-tier-badge/credit-score-transparency\">评分透明与构成解释</a> 的落地要求。缺了这层信息，通知只会引发客服工单而不是行为改变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>等级的作用是把连续分变成语义档位，让权益规则与商家心智共用一套语言。</li>\n<li>阈值应从<strong>目标人数占比反推</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k = F^{-1}(q_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），而不是先拍分数再看人数。</li>\n<li>绝对阈值激励强但预算不可控，相对阈值预算可控但有零和感，混合方案（绝对下限 + 相对上限）是常用的折中。</li>\n<li>等级控制在五档以内；每档加滞回区（升档线高于降档线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>），消除边界抖动带来的频繁升降。</li>\n<li>等级映射与变更事件都要版本化存储，<code>score_at_change</code> 与 <code>scheme_version</code> 是申诉复现的必备字段。</li>\n<li>滞回使等级计算有状态，必须按时间序重放，不能对单条记录独立重算。</li>\n<li>等级变更是<strong>领域事件</strong>：升档立即生效，降档延迟生效并提前通知，通知需含触发维度、当前值与恢复条件。</li>\n<li>等级与标识如何对外展示见 <a href=\"merchant-badge-trust-signal\">信用标识与买家信任展示</a>，等级如何换算成具体权益见 <a href=\"../credit-benefit-link/traffic-payout-term-benefit\">流量/账期/保证金/活动权益</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"信用等级与阈值","id":"信用等级与阈值"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值确定方法","id":"阈值确定方法"},{"level":3,"text":"从目标占比反推，而不是从分数反推","id":"从目标占比反推-而不是从分数反推"},{"level":3,"text":"分布漂移与阈值漂移的取舍","id":"分布漂移与阈值漂移的取舍"},{"level":3,"text":"阈值数量与马丁格尔效应","id":"阈值数量与马丁格尔效应"},{"level":2,"text":"等级映射的工程实现","id":"等级映射的工程实现"},{"level":3,"text":"映射表要可版本化、可回溯","id":"映射表要可版本化-可回溯"},{"level":3,"text":"滞回在存储层怎么落","id":"滞回在存储层怎么落"},{"level":2,"text":"等级变更的传播与通知","id":"等级变更的传播与通知"},{"level":3,"text":"等级是事件源，不是查询结果","id":"等级是事件源-不是查询结果"},{"level":3,"text":"升档与降档的传播策略不同","id":"升档与降档的传播策略不同"},{"level":3,"text":"通知内容必须包含可操作信息","id":"通知内容必须包含可操作信息"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多市场/多店铺信用聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-model-dimension/multi-market-credit-agg"},"next":{"title":"信用标识与买家信任展示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-tier-badge/merchant-badge-trust-signal"}}